# The v1 packages (complementarity_v1/, s1_sensitivity_v1/) are the working sources of
# a run's report: `report` migrates every table into report_v1/, which keeps a
# byte-exact copy of each package manifest. After the migration they are optional
# (`report --check` does not read them) and they stay local.
*/complementarity_v1/
*/s1_sensitivity_v1/
# Failed or stopped attempts are never read by code and stay local.
*/*_failed_*.json
*/*_population_failure.json
*/*_fit_stopped.json
